{"video":"xRpITsBLeN0","lines":[{"t":[0.5,4.9],"en":"- Gentlemen, Wilderness Weekend is upon us."},{"t":[4.9,6.6],"en":"There will be no video games."},{"t":[6.6,9],"en":"There will be no internet pads."},{"t":[9,13.5],"en":"This weekend you have two parents, me and Mother Nature."},{"t":[13.5,16.8],"en":"- And I am Mother Nature's brother."},{"t":[17.7,18.9],"en":"Brother Nature."},{"t":[18.9,22.3],"en":"But you can call me Andy or Brother Nature."},{"t":[22.3,23.8],"en":"Your call."},{"t":[23.8,24.8],"en":"- Thank you, Andy."},{"t":[24.8,25.8],"en":"- Brother Nature."},{"t":[25.8,27.3],"en":"- For the last three years,"},{"t":[27.3,30.6],"en":"I have served as Troop Leader of the Pawnee Rangers."},{"t":[30.6,32.2],"en":"This is our handbook."},{"t":[34.5,37],"en":"I wrote the whole thing myself."},{"t":[37,38.9],"en":"- Okay, it's time to give out the badges."},{"t":[38.9,40.6],"en":"Let's see, Emily, you get the badge"},{"t":[40.6,42],"en":"for most community service."},{"t":[43.2,46.7],"en":"To Casey, the best penguin blog badge."},{"t":[46.7,50.6],"en":"To Abigail, flyest hairstyle."},{"t":[50.6,53],"en":"And Anne gets the badge for second flyest hairstyle."},{"t":[53,55.1],"en":"- Oh, I wasn't competing for that."},{"t":[55.1,56],"en":"- I'll say."},{"t":[56,58],"en":"Five years ago, a plucky fifth grader"},{"t":[58,60],"en":"wanted to join the Pawnee Rangers."},{"t":[60,61.5],"en":"But their executive council said"},{"t":[61.5,63.2],"en":"what obnoxious jerks always say."},{"t":[63.2,64.9],"en":"No, this is males only."},{"t":[64.9,66.6],"en":"Go start your own club."},{"t":[66.6,68.1],"en":"She couldn't."},{"t":[68.1,69.5],"en":"So I did."},{"t":[69.5,70.8],"en":"We're called the Pawnee Goddesses"},{"t":[70.8,72],"en":"and we're freaking awesome."},{"t":[73.2,75.3],"en":"Hey, Ron, whose club do you think is better?"},{"t":[75.3,76.7],"en":"Yours or mine?"},{"t":[76.7,77.8],"en":"The answer is mine."},{"t":[77.8,78.7],"en":"Say mine is better."},{"t":[78.7,80.1],"en":"- It's not a competition."},{"t":[80.1,81.4],"en":"- Oh, but it is."},{"t":[81.4,82.6],"en":"Your club made it a competition"},{"t":[82.6,84.1],"en":"when they kept girls out."},{"t":[84.1,86.8],"en":"Oh my stars, I'm just a little lady."},{"t":[86.8,88.3],"en":"My fragile constitution"},{"t":[88.3,90.6],"en":"cannot handle the fearsome outdoors."},{"t":[90.6,93],"en":"- I have no problem with strong women, Leslie."},{"t":[93,94.2],"en":"- Who's Leslie?"},{"t":[94.2,96.7],"en":"My name is Annabelle Vandergraaf."},{"t":[96.7,100.2],"en":"And y'all, I just fall to pieces"},{"t":[100.2,103.8],"en":"when the sun shines on my herd."},{"t":[103.8,106.6],"en":"- However, the Pawnee Rangers were founded"},{"t":[106.6,109.5],"en":"because some boys want to go out into nature"},{"t":[109.5,111.5],"en":"and learn traditional survival skills"},{"t":[111.5,113.3],"en":"without being distracted by girls."},{"t":[113.3,114.8],"en":"- Well, my awesome goddesses"},{"t":[114.8,117.3],"en":"don't want to be distracted by losers."},{"t":[117.3,118.7],"en":"Say my club is better, Ron."},{"t":[118.7,119.6],"en":"Say it."},{"t":[119.6,120.7],"en":"My club is better."},{"t":[120.7,122.1],"en":"Say it."},{"t":[122.1,123.5],"en":"Come on, say it's better."},{"t":[123.5,124.4],"en":"Say it."},{"t":[124.4,125.3],"en":"Say it's better."},{"t":[125.3,126.1],"en":"- Say my club is better."},{"t":[126.1,127],"en":"- Say it, give it up."},{"t":[127,127.8],"en":"- Whose club is better?"},{"t":[127.8,128.7],"en":"- Mine."},{"t":[128.7,129.6],"en":"- Say it, you know it."},{"t":[129.6,130.5],"en":"- Say it."},{"t":[130.5,131.3],"en":"- On principle, I never say anything"},{"t":[131.3,135.1],"en":"that another person is obviously trying to get me to say."},{"t":[135.1,137.2],"en":"My first wedding ceremony took two hours"},{"t":[137.2,140.4],"en":"because after the priest said repeat after me,"},{"t":[140.4,141.5],"en":"I fell silent."}]}
